stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE_AT_ORIGIN

    state "IDLE_AT_ORIGIN" as IDLE
    state "NAV_TO_PLOT" as NAV_P
    state "AT_PLOT_CAPTURE" as CAP
    state "NAV_TO_ORIGIN" as NAV_O
    state "RECOVERY" as REC
    state "UNABLE_TO_REACH_PLOT" as UNREACHABLE
    state "MISSION_COMPLETE" as DONE

    IDLE --> NAV_P: next_plot_available

    NAV_P --> CAP: distance_to(plot_center) < r_plot
    NAV_P --> REC: progress_stalled\n|| no_safe_command\n|| unsafe_tilt
    NAV_P --> UNREACHABLE: plot_unreachable\n(water/cliff)

    CAP --> NAV_O: photos_captured && qc_pass

    NAV_O --> IDLE: distance_to(origin) < r_origin && remaining_plots > 0
    NAV_O --> DONE: distance_to(origin) < r_origin && remaining_plots == 0
    NAV_O --> REC: progress_stalled || no_safe_command || unsafe_tilt

    REC --> NAV_P: recovered_ok && target == plot
    REC --> NAV_O: recovered_ok && target == origin
    REC --> DONE: recovery_failed

    UNREACHABLE --> IDLE: remaining_plots > 0
    UNREACHABLE --> DONE: remaining_plots == 0

    DONE --> [*]